#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:5
#: cda1ab97e9b2497b8a0fac7f9e7ff46b
msgid ""
"Indoor autonomous flight with ArduCopter, ROS and Aruco Boards Detection"
msgstr "基于 ArduCopter、ROS 和 Aruco 板检测的室内自主飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:11
#: 40f8a85692c94dc9b421b1768585db75
msgid ""
"This wiki page describes how to setup a system capable to realize indoor "
"autonomous flight. The system is based on a quadcopter with a Raspberry Pi 3"
" and a Raspberry Pi Camera Module v2. Images from camera are used to "
"calculate poses estimation on the Raspberry Pi and the result are sent as "
"MAVLink messages to the Flight Controller. The camera is downward looking "
"and on the floor there is an Aruco Boards like this:"
msgstr ""
"本 wiki 页面介绍如何搭建能够实现室内自主飞行的系统。该系统基于配备树莓派 3 和树莓派摄像头模块 v2 "
"的四旋翼飞行器。摄像头图像用于在树莓派上计算位姿估计，结果以 MAVLink 消息发送到飞控。摄像头朝下，地板上放置如下所示的 Aruco 板："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:18
#: 8e8bbc5c22a249a2a6fdaf1f46b57072
msgid ""
"The system uses `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ for all the tasks it has to "
"do. The images from Raspberry Pi Camera are captured by `raspicam_node "
"<https://github.com/UbiquityRobotics/raspicam_node>`__, the poses estimation"
" are calculated by a modified version of `aruco_gridboard "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard>`__ and the relevant messages "
"are sent to the Flight Controller using `mavros "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__. All this ROS packages, and other we will "
"see later, runs on the Raspberry Pi 3."
msgstr ""
"该系统使用 `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ 完成所有任务。树莓派摄像头图像由 `raspicam_node "
"<https://github.com/UbiquityRobotics/raspicam_node>`__ 采集，位姿估计由修改版 "
"`aruco_gridboard <https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard>`__ 计算，相关消息通过 "
"`mavros <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__ 发送到飞控。所有这些 ROS 软件包以及后续介绍的其他软件包均在树莓派 "
"3 上运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:20
#: 80894f71d06b462cb329fb5f0ce9def5
msgid ""
"The ROS node raspicam_node publish camera/image and camera/camera_info "
"topics, the node aruco_gridboard subscribes to these topics and publish a "
"camera_pose message to the mavros/vision_pose/pose topic, mavros translates "
"ROS messages in MAVLink messages and send it to the Flight Controller."
msgstr ""
"ROS 节点 raspicam_node 发布 camera/image 和 camera/camera_info 话题，aruco_gridboard"
" 节点订阅这些话题并向 mavros/vision_pose/pose 话题发布 camera_pose 消息，mavros 将 ROS 消息转换为 "
"MAVLink 消息并发送到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:22
#: bb8ed56bb81048b1b32944303a106221
msgid ""
"The messages SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN and a SET_HOME_POSITION are sent with a "
"`script "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__"
" before starting to use the system."
msgstr ""
"在开始使用系统前，需通过 `脚本 "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__"
" 发送 SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN 和 SET_HOME_POSITION 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:24
#: 1b05208c78b74c13a9e69f52d9fe4360
msgid ""
"The Flight Controller and the Raspberry Pi 3 on the quadcopter are connected"
" via serial port whereas the Rapsberry Pi 3 and the desktop PC are connected"
" via WiFi. The desktop PC is used only for configuration and visualization "
"purposes. `rviz <http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ from ROS is used for "
"visualization on PC."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼上的飞控与树莓派 3 通过串口连接，树莓派 3 与台式电脑通过 WiFi 连接。台式电脑仅用于配置和可视化。使用 ROS 的 `rviz "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ 在电脑上进行可视化。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:27
#: 56f06e1d019044d9a066926d439584d6
msgid "Components of the system"
msgstr "系统组成"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:29
#: 763893b0bcd6443c9f8a59d56697177c
msgid ""
"A little quadcopter (160mm) with Revolution Flight Controller with "
"ArduCopter 3.7-dev and the following relevant parameters:"
msgstr "一台 160mm 小型四旋翼，搭载 Revolution 飞控，运行 ArduCopter 3.7-dev，相关参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:51
#: 9d85a163fcc5466e82043fc6c58df1db
msgid ""
"On the quadcopter there is a Raspberry Pi 3 (connected to Flight Controller "
"with serial port) and a Raspberry Pi Camera"
msgstr "四旋翼上安装了树莓派 3（通过串口连接到飞控）和树莓派摄像头"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:52
#: eec2e18bd7d043febc46d54eaeea839a
msgid ""
"On the Raspberry Pi there is ROS Kinetic with raspicam_node, aruco_gridboard"
" and mavros packages."
msgstr "树莓派上运行 ROS Kinetic，安装了 raspicam_node、aruco_gridboard 和 mavros 软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:55
#: cfa2552ad7c94e1b8b55d5b66e448339
msgid "Instructions to reproduce the system"
msgstr "系统复现说明"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:58
#: 4d310b47c6954fedaf114142b8dcaecd
msgid "On the Raspberry Pi 3 on quadcopter"
msgstr "在四旋翼上的树莓派 3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:59
#: 57c24d76b7d04a5ca96fae62db78770d
msgid ""
"Install Ubuntu 16.04 and ROS Kinetic with Ubiquity Robotics `Raspberry Pi "
"images <https://downloads.ubiquityrobotics.com/pi.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"使用 Ubiquity Robotics 的 `树莓派镜像 "
"<https://downloads.ubiquityrobotics.com/pi.html>`__ 安装 Ubuntu 16.04 和 ROS "
"Kinetic"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:60
#: 18b568c6d9ca403492a500587f000b5a
msgid ""
"Edit /boot/config.txt to have higher serial speed on /dev/ttyAMA0 "
"(connection at 921600 baud)"
msgstr "编辑 /boot/config.txt 以提高 /dev/ttyAMA0 的串口速度（连接波特率为 921600）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:72
#: 61fceb582f224edc93bbaf77b569bd01
msgid ""
"Connect the serial port with one telemetry port on the Flight Controller"
msgstr "将串口与飞控的某个数传端口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:73
#: 79dbbee40bd2433d9bf5bef47b354d29
msgid ""
"Connect to the PC using WiFi following the `instructions "
"<https://learn.ubiquityrobotics.com/connect_network>`__ on Ubiquity Robotics"
" site"
msgstr ""
"参照 Ubiquity Robotics 网站的 `说明 "
"<https://learn.ubiquityrobotics.com/connect_network>`__ 通过 WiFi 连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:74
#: 1232b4bb967b431d9ab00919ad09246e
msgid ""
"Edit mavros configuration file apm_config.yaml to syncronize the flight "
"controller and companion computer (Raspberry Pi) clocks using MAVLink’s "
"SYSTEM_TIME and TIMESYNC messages as in this `wiki "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-timesync.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"编辑 mavros 配置文件 apm_config.yaml，使用 MAVLink 的 SYSTEM_TIME 和 TIMESYNC "
"消息同步飞控与伴飞计算机（树莓派）时钟，参见此 `wiki <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-"
"timesync.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:75
#: 50da1110025d423aa4a25d2f32675301
msgid ""
"Calibrate the camera following the instructions in this `wiki "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/camera_calibration/Tutorials/MonocularCalibration>`__"
msgstr ""
"参照此 `wiki "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/camera_calibration/Tutorials/MonocularCalibration>`__ "
"的说明标定摄像头"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:76
#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:107
#: 0b988aa9f395452f8f4ed4d4f636c2ca 5cbfeac5938e4698b97fb2bc4817e0ca
msgid ""
"Clone this fork of `aruco_gridboard "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard>`__ in ~/catkin_ws/src"
msgstr ""
"将此 `aruco_gridboard <https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard>`__ 分支克隆到 "
"~/catkin_ws/src"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:108
#: 3d730c1156d54d0f936604d19687f669 fa1124ba85d1474fba67adee307623a5
msgid "Build all"
msgstr "全部构建"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:86
#: 7db3ec66857f4e76b79302f8209d293d
msgid "On the desktop PC"
msgstr "在台式电脑上"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:87
#: 6f946563d4a644778e29871c779f714b
msgid ""
"Install `ROS Kinetic <http://wiki.ros.org/kinetic/Installation/Ubuntu>`__ on"
" Ubuntu 16.04 (maybe newer version work the same but was not tested)"
msgstr ""
"在 Ubuntu 16.04 上安装 `ROS Kinetic "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/kinetic/Installation/Ubuntu>`__（更新版本可能同样适用，但未经测试）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:88
#: eef164e43a2e488eb56ef1d430dc400b
msgid ""
"Install ros-kinetic-joy-teleop (sudo apt install ros-kinetic-joy-teleop) and"
" configure for your Joystick - We use a Joystick instead of RC because using"
" 2.4GHz RC disturb the WiFi video streaming. In mavros there is a "
"configuration file for Logitech F710 Joystick, In the aruco_gridboard "
"package we added a configuration file for the Xbox one Joystick."
msgstr ""
"安装 ros-kinetic-joy-teleop（sudo apt install ros-kinetic-joy-"
"teleop）并为您的手柄进行配置——我们使用手柄代替遥控器，因为 2.4GHz 遥控器会干扰 WiFi 视频流。mavros 中有 Logitech "
"F710 手柄的配置文件，aruco_gridboard 软件包中添加了 Xbox One 手柄的配置文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:90
#: adf0f2787ac64305a1403739ad127370
msgid "Install mavros (sudo apt install ros-kinetic-mavros*)"
msgstr "安装 mavros（sudo apt install ros-kinetic-mavros*）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:91
#: b8aef294c3334b058ec35c7f8d4408a7
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with ROS follow the `tutorials "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials>`__"
msgstr "如不熟悉 ROS，请参照 `教程 <http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:92
#: d96dcd59e7854aedb6c8b9b018eb7ada
msgid "Edit ~/.bashrc and append the following line:"
msgstr "编辑 ~/.bashrc 并追加以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:98
#: 8fb9b32505744036a8c700401b2eb48a
msgid ""
"Create a Catkin WorkSpace (on Raspberry Pi this is not necessary because it "
"is already in Ubiquity Robotics image)"
msgstr "创建 Catkin 工作空间（树莓派上无需此步骤，因为 Ubiquity Robotics 镜像中已包含）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:115
#: ddba0727592f4877a2cf66760e0bd16b
msgid ""
"On PC you also have to run a GCS of your choice to configure the quadcopter,"
" see telemetry data, see MAVLink inspector, set flight modes and give "
"commands. All of this things can be done also via ROS messages and services "
"but in this way could be easier."
msgstr ""
"在电脑上还需运行您选择的地面站（GCS）来配置四旋翼、查看数传数据、MAVLink 检查器、设置飞行模式和发送指令。所有这些操作也可通过 ROS "
"消息和服务实现，但这种方式可能更简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:118
#: ec378d632cec441eb499fb33b131cff3
msgid "Starting all ROS node"
msgstr "启动所有 ROS 节点"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:119
#: 0606fa3eb2354dee850e39886f62a57f
msgid ""
"Now to start all the node needed by the system to work give the following "
"command on different term (or tab with CTRL+SHIFT+T) (in this example "
"192.168.10.16 is the PC and 192.168.10.10 is the Raspberry Pi on the "
"quadcopter)"
msgstr ""
"现在在不同终端（或用 CTRL+SHIFT+T 新建标签页）中输入以下命令启动系统所需的所有节点（本示例中 192.168.10.16 "
"为电脑，192.168.10.10 为四旋翼上的树莓派）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:122
#: 17d3e7c6c3aa48e692e44f59726a8633
msgid "tab1"
msgstr "标签页 1"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:130
#: 367cf44b4331474eab1404df1798d29d
msgid "tab2"
msgstr "标签页 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:138
#: d8d101c0e20d47c3983917ffe9f48f98
msgid "tab3"
msgstr "标签页 3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:146
#: c3b049a2b6aa4693afedcd84fd36a0b6
msgid "tab4"
msgstr "标签页 4"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:153
#: f2aeeeaefe024b058f776526ee01a9f7
msgid "tab5"
msgstr "标签页 5"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:159
#: db066bbdabd54ed89f74283795935a49
msgid ""
"At this point it should be possible to see /mavros/vision_pose/pose and "
"/mavros/local_position/pose, represented as 3 Axes, on rviz and moving the "
"quadcopter with the camera towards the Aruco Board, you should see the two "
"poses moving close to each other. Connecting the GCS to the quadcopter (tcp "
"192.168.10.10 2000) it should be possible to see the quadcopter on the map, "
"set flight mode and give commands."
msgstr ""
"此时应能在 rviz 中看到以 3 轴表示的 /mavros/vision_pose/pose 和 "
"/mavros/local_position/pose，将四旋翼的摄像头朝向 Aruco 板移动时，应看到两个位姿互相靠近。将地面站连接到四旋翼（tcp"
" 192.168.10.10 2000）后，应能在地图上看到四旋翼，并设置飞行模式和发送指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:165
#: b2ded59060a64ef09cb7f485be350ea5
msgid ""
"If this last point is OK the first test could be done arming the quadcopter "
"in Loiter mode, takeoff and hover over the Aruco Board with the Joystick, "
"then land."
msgstr "若以上步骤正常，可进行首次测试：在定点悬停模式下解锁四旋翼，用手柄起飞并在 Aruco 板上方悬停，然后降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:167
#: 624212815b3246d690d96705856a667d
msgid ""
"The last step (for now) is to test an all autonomous flight using one of the"
" script included, to do this open another term or tab"
msgstr "最后一步（目前阶段）是使用内含脚本之一测试全自主飞行，为此打开另一个终端或标签页"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:175
#: c54ac03c266e412da8343db574ede9c1
msgid ""
"You should see the quadcopter arm, takeoff, flight along the square and land"
" as showed in the video at the beginning of this page."
msgstr "您应能看到四旋翼解锁、起飞、沿方形路径飞行并降落，如本页开头视频所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:178
#: 336b0aaef3c349d583732903804ca580
msgid "Some Useful links"
msgstr "相关参考链接"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:180
#: 13353734c7074933bd8b2f70b0bdf024
msgid ""
"Blog post `Indoor autonomous flight with ArduCopter, ROS and Aruco Boards "
"Detection <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/indoor-autonomous-flight-with-"
"arducopter-ros-and-aruco-boards-detection/34699>`__: A similar system to the"
" one described here but on the quadcopter there is a Raspberry Pi 0 (instead"
" of Raspberry Pi 3), due to the limited computing resources the "
"aruco_gridboard node run on desktop PC and the relevant data (mainly images "
"and pose estimation) are exchanged with the quadcopter using ROS messages."
msgstr ""
"博客文章 `基于 ArduCopter、ROS 和 Aruco 板检测的室内自主飞行 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/indoor-autonomous-flight-with-arducopter-"
"ros-and-aruco-boards-detection/34699>`__：与本文所述系统类似，但四旋翼上使用树莓派 0（而非树莓派 "
"3），由于计算资源有限，aruco_gridboard 节点在台式电脑上运行，相关数据（主要是图像和位姿估计）通过 ROS 消息与四旋翼交换。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-aruco-detection.rst:183
#: 452c46ecfb8247f088e2b3eaace4d3db
msgid ""
"Blog post `Vision Positionning Experiments using SKYVIPER "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/vision-positionning-experiments-using-"
"skyviper/38348>`__: Here is described a system similar to the previous one, "
"in place of the DIY quadcopter a Skyviper one is used, because of this it "
"should be easier to replicate."
msgstr ""
"博客文章 `使用 SKYVIPER 的视觉定位实验 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/vision-"
"positionning-experiments-using-skyviper/38348>`__：描述了与上一篇类似的系统，使用 Skyviper "
"代替 DIY 四旋翼，因此应更易于复现。"
